ai.spec:
getMove(roll):
if asc >= 17:
  if firstTurn (moveHistory[0]==INVALID): HEX
  else if lastMove != DEBILITATE and lastMove != DRAIN: (roll < 50 ? DEBILITATE : DRAIN)
  else: (roll < 40 ? ZAP : POKE)
else (asc < 17):
  if firstTurn: POKE
  else if moveHistory[1]==INVALID (exactly one move taken, i.e. this roll sets turn 2): HEX
  else if lastMove != DEBILITATE and lastMove != DRAIN: (roll < 50 ? DEBILITATE : DRAIN)
  else: (roll < 40 ? ZAP : POKE)
All five moves queue RollMove at end of turn (next move rolled in the end-of-turn action queue).
DRAIN applies STRENGTH 3 to self immediately during the turn; WEAK 3 on player is queued.

hp quirk: initHp burns one extra monsterHpRng.random(54,60) roll before the real HP roll (game parity; 2 hpRng calls total).
getMove: always SCOURING_WHIP (roll consumed but ignored).
turn SCOURING_WHIP: attack 7 (never asc-scaled);
  if asc >= 18: queue BuffEnemy STRENGTH +1 on self, then queue 3 Wounds into the discard pile;
  else if asc >= 3: queue 2 Wounds into discard;
  else: queue 1 Wound into discard;
  then noOpRollMove (burns one aiRng.random(99)).
Appears in the SLAVERS elite encounter as the middle monster (Blue Slaver idx 0, Taskmaster idx 1, Red Slaver idx 2) and in The Colosseum event (Taskmaster idx 0, Gremlin Nob idx 1).
